Rule 4 (out must match the broadcasted shape of input and other to avoid size mismatch errors)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor, v_3: tensor} |= ndim(v_3) = ndim(v_1) ∧ ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ (if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : ((shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∧ shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i)) ∨ (shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∧ shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_2, i)) ∨ (shape(v_2, i) = 1 ∧ shape(v_3, i) = shape(v_1, i))))
